d dollars which you know I don't  know what it costs  to educate those immigrants but I I read  summaries like two or three thousand  dollars a year and we're talking about  hundreds of thousands of immigrants we  spend I'm sure we have spent billions of  dollars so it's far better far more  economical to say to the immigrants if  you achieve level X you get twenty  thousand dollars okay now you go and  educate yourself wherever you want if  you want to go to school with that  that's fine but they at the end the end  result is twenty thousand dollars so you  pay for the result you don't pay for  people to attend school such has been  the case with these Mandarin speaking  immigrants who have been studying  English and paid for by the government  and who make no progress you pay for the  result if you achieve the result you get  this money so it's your risk if you  don't think you're gonna get there you  won't spend the money fine but then the  results won't be very different from  what they are now because right now  according to this study they don't  improve anyway so yeah well I kind of  meandered around a few topics and I'm  sure I'll get a fair amount of negative  comment as usual but I look forward to  your opinions thank you for listening

